  "decision": "Retain the experiment; do not replace bundled semantic v2. The early validation winner underlearns cool fixtures and the final model regresses on stone.",
  "limitations": [
    "Labels are agent-reviewed. The repeated two-layout validation set contains warm sources but no marked cool fixtures.",
    "Ship results cover partial training regions, not generalization; pixels outside reviewed regions are ignored.",
    "Astral, new camp, and Dyson 15 are previously observed test layouts, kept out of training and checkpoint selection.",
    "Procedural test seeds measure the generator task, not real artwork accuracy.",
    "The restricted optimizer disables decay on all first-convolution weights, including new context columns; this is not a pure one-factor comparison with trial 18.",
